[{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0060","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-8350","title":"WordPress Calls to Action 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 Calls to Action 插件 2.5.1 之前版本中存在多处反射型跨站脚本漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 wp-admin/edit.php 页面的 open-tab 参数或 ab-testing-call-to-action-example/ 页面的 wp-cta-variation-id 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员访问特制链接时脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 Calls to Action 插件 2.5.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2015-8350"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-11T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:34:21Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress Calls to Action 插件升级至 2.5.1 或更高版本。在 WordPress 后台插件管理页面搜索 \"Calls to Action\" 并点击更新，或手动下载最新版本替换。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用该插件，并在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中添加规则过滤 `open-tab` 和 `wp-cta-variation-id` 参数中的恶意脚本内容作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/134598/WordPress-Calls-To-Action-2.4.3-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/537022/100/0/threaded","https://wordpress.org/plugins/cta/#developers","https://www.htbridge.com/advisory/HTB23274","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8350.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-8350.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8350.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2015/8xxx/CVE-2015-8350.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/bdcc854494aa2f43778044680cffe9dd4de3de0e/nuclei-templates/2015/CVE-2015-8350-cta-b2ac2e50-1eef-46e6-8d57-c9d2dc04f933.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-8350-569e41eec8ee28db49d01f6e5c3a16c5.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-8350_1.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-8350.rules","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-8350.json","https://github.com/1979139113/0day-today-exploits/blob/8b2194688e3c722fe9369b045e37382e7f45e12b/24651.txt","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2015-8350.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0059","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-8349","title":"SourceBans 2.0 pre-alpha 跨站点脚本漏洞","description":"SourceBans 2.0 pre-alpha 版本中存在跨站脚本漏洞，攻击者可通过向 index.php 页面的 advSearch 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码触发该漏洞。当管理员或其他用户访问被注入恶意脚本的页面时，脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致会话劫持、敏感信息泄露等危害。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击恶意链接），CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2015-8349"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-11T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:34:21Z","remediation":"SourceBans 2.0 pre-alpha 及之前版本（含 1.4.11）的 index.php 中 advSearch 参数未对用户输入做任何过滤，导致反射型 XSS。由于该项目已停止维护，官方未发布修复补丁。建议：1）修改 sourcebans/index.php，对 advSearch 参数使用 htmlspecialchars($input, ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8') 进行输出编码；2）在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面添加 WAF 规则，拦截包含 `<script>`、`onerror=`、`onload=` 等 XSS 载荷的 advSearch 请求参数；3）考虑迁移至 SourceBans++（社区维护分支）等仍在维护的替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/537018/100/0/threaded","https://www.htbridge.com/advisory/HTB23273","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8349.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-8349.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8349.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-8349/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-8349.py","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2015-8349-2610.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2015-8349-2613.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8349.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-8349_3.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2015-8349.js","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4b74680d5a0e543abc5d2cd403e55944096555a8/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-83xx/CVE-2015-8349.json","https://github.com/OracleNep/Nday-Exploit-Plan/blob/e06c9cdebe11066693b40e07ac82c9b7af73ffd8/CVE/CVE-2015-8349/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0208","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2291","title":"Intel 网络适配器诊断驱动程序 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Intel 网卡诊断驱动程序 IQVW32.sys (1.3.1.0 前版本) 和 IQVW64.sys (1.3.1.0 前版本) 存在 IOCTL 处理漏洞，由于对 IOCTL 码 0x80862013、0x8086200B、0x8086200F、0x80862007 的输入验证不当 (CWE-20)，本地攻击者可通过发送精心构造的 IOCTL 请求触发内核缓冲区溢出或类型混淆，导致拒绝服务或以内核权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响安装有受影响版本 Intel 网卡诊断驱动的 Windows 系统，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8 (HIGH)，攻击向量为本地、低攻击复杂度、低权限、无需用户交互，机密性/完整性/可用性影响均为高。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限并能打开设备句柄发送 IOCTL，已有公开 PoC (ExploitDB-36392、GitHub 多个 PoC) 及 CISA 已知被利用漏洞目录收录，Intel 已在 1.3.1.0 版本修复，建议升级驱动程序至 1.3.1.0 或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2291"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-08-09T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:23:52Z","remediation":"将 Windows 系统上的 Intel 以太网诊断驱动 IQVW32.sys 和 IQVW64.sys 升级至 1.3.1.0 或更高版本，可通过 Intel 安全公告 INTEL-SA-00051（https://security-center.intel.com/advisory.aspx?intelid=INTEL-SA-00051）获取补丁驱动。如暂时无法安装补丁，可通过修改 \\\\.\\Nal 设备对象的访问控制列表（DACL）限制普通用户对设备句柄的读写权限，以降低本地用户利用 IOCTL 0x80862013、0x8086200B、0x8086200F、0x80862007 发起内核态代码执行或系统崩溃的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/130854/Intel-Network-Adapter-Diagnostic-Driver-IOCTL-DoS.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/79623","https://security-center.intel.com/advisory.aspx?intelid=INTEL-SA-00051&languageid=en-fr","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36392/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-2291","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36392","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2291.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/264ef61746a7918b62cf1abbd77516d3c9b09ba8/2015/CVE-2015-2291.json","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/4157b55637aa886612c3d03a7462774960d7e082/archive/gmh5225/CVE-2015-2291.txt","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/62d3575ad7f5edb0085d16f3737a19e0c0ea724b/2015/CVE-2015-2291/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2291","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2291.json","https://github.com/hfiref0x/KDU/blob/adbc2ce2682dacddcced739c88f06b9a39e90132/Source/Hamakaze/idrv/intel.h","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2015/database/CVE-2015-2291/Intel-CVE-2015-2291-Tare05.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-2291.html","https://github.com/bats3c/Ghost-In-The-Logs/blob/a8aaee7384467a426bfc0dada021d6125009c179/Source/src/idrv/nal.h","https://github.com/gmh5225/CVE-2015-2291","https://github.com/Tare05/Intel-CVE-2015-2291","https://github.com/ethanedits/iqvw64e-privilege-escalation"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0057","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0057.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-7780","title":"ZOHO ManageEngine Firewall Analyzer 目录遍历漏洞","description":"ZOHO ManageEngine Firewall Analyzer 8.0 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22），由于对用户提供的文件路径参数缺乏充分过滤和验证，具有低权限的认证攻击者可通过向受影响系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用路径遍历序列（如 `../`）突破目录限制，读取服务器上任意敏感文件（如配置文件、系统日志等），导致机密信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，仅需网络访问和低权限认证即可利用。厂商已在 Firewall Analyzer 8.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-7780"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-06-27T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:33:07Z","remediation":"立即将 ZOHO ManageEngine Firewall Analyzer 升级到 8.0 或更高版本。该漏洞存在于 8.0 之前的所有版本中，攻击者可利用目录遍历漏洞读取服务器任意文件。如无法立即升级，建议限制对 Firewall Analyzer Web 控制台的网络访问，仅允许可信 IP 通过防火墙规则访问管理端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN21968837/index.html","http://jvndb.jvn.jp/ja/contents/2015/JVNDB-2015-000185.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-7780.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-7780.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-7780.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-7780/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-7780.py","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2015-7780-2601.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2015-7780-2604.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2015-7780-2602.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-7780_39.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2015/7xxx/CVE-2015-7780.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-7780.rules","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-7780"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0046","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-5469","title":"WordPress MDC YouTube Downloader 插件 2.1.0 文件绝对路径遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 MDC YouTube Downloader 插件 2.1.0 版本中 includes/download.php 存在绝对路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 file 参数传入完整绝对路径，绕过目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击条件简单，仅需目标站点安装并启用该插件即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-5469"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-05-23T04:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:29:10Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 MDC YouTube Downloader 插件，该插件已因安全原因从 WordPress 官方仓库下架且不再维护。如必须保留下载功能，可替换为其他活跃维护的 YouTube 下载插件（如 YouTube Embed 或 Download YouTube Videos）。若暂时无法删除，在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面添加规则阻止对 `/wp-content/plugins/mdc-youtube-downloader/includes/download.php` 的访问，或在 WAF 中拦截包含 `file` 参数包含绝对路径（如 `/etc/`、`/var/`）的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2015/07/07/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2015/07/10/5","http://www.vapid.dhs.org/advisory.php?v=133","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-5469.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-5469.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f0b5f4bdc45a495b4184bd2ebc02bf95dd4ebcf7/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-5469.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2015/5xxx/CVE-2015-5469.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-5469.rules","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-5469_1.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2015-5469.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-5469-58f92a4d584962fc92f57c003cb8298e.yaml","https://github.com/xiongjungit/SecurityManageFramwork-SeMF/blob/fcf87e09ac20ac2ef777a39281d8dad277cac9ad/cnvd_xml/xml_file/2017-05-29_2017-06-04.xml","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/nuclei/nuclei.txt","https://github.com/Bmcbob76/prometheus-prime/blob/952c957f0c453e1048be9399b27309a12965e432/NUCLEI_TEMPLATES/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-5469.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0037","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-4455","title":"WordPress Aviary Image Editor Add-on For Gravity Forms插件任意文件上传漏洞","description":"WordPress Aviary Image Editor Add-on For Gravity Forms 插件 3.0 beta 版本中的 includes/upload.php 存在任意文件上传漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该上传接口发送特制请求，上传包含恶意可执行扩展名的文件（如 PHP 脚本），随后通过直接访问 wp-content/uploads/gform_aviary 目录下的上传文件即可执行任意代码，完全控制目标网站服务器。该漏洞影响该插件的 3.0 beta 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-4455"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-05-23T04:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:27:18Z","remediation":"立即停用并删除 Aviary Image Editor Add-on For Gravity Forms 插件，该插件已从 WordPress 官方仓库下架且不再维护。检查 wp-content/uploads/gform_aviary/ 目录下是否存在可疑 PHP 文件，如有则删除。作为替代方案，可选用其他受支持的 WordPress 图片编辑插件（如 Classic Editor + 媒体库自带编辑功能）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132256/WordPress-Aviary-Image-Editor-Add-On-For-Gravity-Forms-3.0-Beta-Shell-Upload.html","http://www.vapid.dhs.org/advisory.php?v=125","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37275","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4455.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-4455.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-4455.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2015/4xxx/CVE-2015-4455.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-4455","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-4455-7d9a49758ec4a0e1bba306ea632621c1.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-4455_1.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-4455.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2015-4455.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-4455.rules","https://github.com/strawberri3s/DotBot/blob/842d191dd290f8ca041ec3c5897bb16e13ee1eea/CVE_2015_4455_gravityformsindex.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0037.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2015/EXP-AVE-2015-0037.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0053","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-7245","title":"D-Link DVG-N5402SP 目录遍历漏洞","description":"D-Link DVG-N5402SP 存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22），远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向设备的 `errorpage` 参数传入 `../` 路径穿越序列，读取设备上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、系统密码等）。该漏洞影响固件版本 W1000CN-00、W1000CN-03 及 W2000EN-00，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商未发布官方补丁，建议限制设备管理页面的网络访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-7245"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-04-24T18:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:32:07Z","remediation":"该设备已停止支持，D-Link 未发布固件补丁。建议立即将设备置于防火墙后，限制仅受信 IP 访问 8080 管理端口；或直接替换为受支持的设备。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器层面过滤 errorpage 参数中的 `../` 路径遍历字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/135590/D-Link-DVG-N5402SP-Path-Traversal-Information-Disclosure.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2016/Feb/24","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39409/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-7245.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-7245.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f0b5f4bdc45a495b4184bd2ebc02bf95dd4ebcf7/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-7245.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2015/7xxx/CVE-2015-7245.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-7245_1.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-7245.rules","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2015-7245.yaml","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2015/7xxx/CVE-2015-7245.json","https://github.com/fullhunt/0day-today-archive/blob/0215d767ce49116865643f4a65678289c41dfba4/data/24899.json","https://github.com/chessredoffsec/nuclei-templates/blob/bf798045b1c57839b4998bf6e08c74fbfd076879/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-7245.yaml","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--b003eb25-e0ab-4d20-b4b3-247458543825.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0053.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0063","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0063.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-8813","title":"Umbraco CMS 服务端请求伪造漏洞","description":"Umbraco CMS 7.4.0 之前版本的 FeedProxy.aspx.cs 页面中 Page_Load 函数存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 url 参数传入特制的恶意 URL，诱使服务器端发起未授权的内部请求，从而访问内网资源或执行端口扫描。攻击者需诱导用户访问恶意链接，无需身份认证即可利用。该漏洞影响 Umbraco CMS 7.4.0 以下所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。官方已在 7.4.0 版本中通过提交 924a016 修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2015-8813"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-03-03T16:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:35:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 Umbraco CMS 至 7.4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 FeedProxy.aspx.cs 中 url 参数未做白名单校验导致的 SSRF 漏洞。如无法升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 层面拦截对 /umbraco/dashboard/FeedProxy.aspx 的异常外联请求，或删除该文件以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://issues.umbraco.org/issue/U4-7457","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2016/02/16/10","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2016/02/17/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2016/02/17/5","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2016/02/18/8","https://github.com/umbraco/Umbraco-CMS/commit/924a016ffe7ae7ea6d516c07a7852f0095eddbce","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8813.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-8813.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8813.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-8813/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-8813.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-8813_31.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8813.yaml","https://github.com/OracleNep/Nday-Exploit-Plan/blob/e06c9cdebe11066693b40e07ac82c9b7af73ffd8/CVE/CVE-2015-8813/README.md","https://github.com/woc-hack/kjd/blob/19869588676a19dd91ecd601bd03bb001278289b/output.demo1/log.status.thread5","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2015-8813-2621.yaml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/nuget/Umbraco.CMS/CVE-2015-8813.yml","https://github.com/Jimi-Lab/workflow/blob/64e0ded287550d9a2309e6b5a8188e373d9e88ca/VulnVersion/DataSet/CveDetail/CVE-2020-8169/openwall/list_openwall.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0020","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2794","title":"DotNetNuke 安装向导权限绕过漏洞","description":"DotNetNuke（DNN）在 7.4.1 之前版本中存在安全绕过漏洞，安装向导页面 Install/InstallWizard.aspx 在系统完成初始安装后未正确移除或设置访问权限，导致远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可直接访问该页面并重新执行安装流程。攻击者通过向目标发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发该漏洞，在安装过程中创建新的 SuperUser 管理员账户，从而完全控制整个 DNN 站点。该漏洞影响所有 7.4.1 之前版本的 DotNetNuke 部署，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2794"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-02-06T15:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 DotNetNuke 至 7.4.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复安装向导未授权访问问题。如无法立即升级，删除或重命名 Install 目录下的 InstallWizard.aspx 文件，或在 Web 服务器（IIS）层面限制对 /Install/InstallWizard.aspx 路径的访问，仅允许管理员 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.dnnsoftware.com/community-blog/cid/155198/workaround-for-potential-security-issue","http://www.dnnsoftware.com/community/security/security-center","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/96373","https://dotnetnuke.codeplex.com/releases/view/615317","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39777/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39777","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2794.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2794.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2015/CVE-2015-2794.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2794.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-2794/poc/others/README.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2015-2794.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CVE-2015-2794-2023-09-21-1730_1","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-2794_1.yaml","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2015/database/CVE-2015-2015/DNN_CVE-2015-2794-styx00.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/13e17ac40c12fcaa921f27e9c8534f670bd0f2c1/plugins/dotnetnuke/dotnetnuke/CVE-2015-2794.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2015/CVE-2015-2794/README.md","https://github.com/styx00/DNN_CVE-2015-2794","https://github.com/wilsc0w/CVE-2015-2794-finder"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0016","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2080","title":"Eclipse Jetty 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Eclipse Jetty 在 9.2.9.v20150224 之前版本的异常处理代码中存在敏感信息泄露漏洞（JetLeak）。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送包含非法字符的 HTTP 请求头，即可触发异常处理流程中的缓冲区错误，导致进程内存中的敏感数据（如会话令牌、密钥、其他用户请求数据等）被泄露。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 Jetty 的 Web 应用服务器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求头实现远程信息窃取，无需任何前置权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2080"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-07T14:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:23:33Z","remediation":"升级 Eclipse Jetty 至 9.2.9.v20150224 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面过滤包含非法字符（如 0x0 等控制字符）的 HTTP 请求头，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://dev.eclipse.org/mhonarc/lists/jetty-announce/msg00074.html","http://dev.eclipse.org/mhonarc/lists/jetty-announce/msg00075.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2015-March/151804.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/130567/Jetty-9.2.8-Shared-Buffer-Leakage.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2015/Mar/12","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/534755/100/1600/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/72768","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031800","https://blog.gdssecurity.com/labs/2015/2/25/jetleak-vulnerability-remote-leakage-of-shared-buffers-in-je.html","https://github.com/eclipse/jetty.project/blob/jetty-9.2.x/advisories/2015-02-24-httpparser-error-buffer-bleed.md","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20190307-0005/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39455","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2080.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2080.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2080.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2015-2080-2492.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2080.py","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2080.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-2080.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/J/jetty_cve-2015-2080.nasl","https://github.com/albinowax/ActiveScanPlusPlus/blob/9a4ac0d929960b24b14374a1cdbac5a8cfc1b0ec/src/burp/JetLeak.java","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-2080_6.yaml","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2080.poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0006","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1000012","title":"WordPress mypixs插件本地文件包含漏洞","description":"WordPress mypixs 插件 v0.3 存在本地文件包含漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用插件对文件路径过滤不严的缺陷，读取服务器上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd、wp-config.php 等敏感文件），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级插件或禁用该插件以修复漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1000012"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-06T14:59:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:21:16Z","remediation":"立即卸载并删除 mypixs 插件（该插件已于 2007 年关闭下架，不再维护且无安全更新）。如暂时无法删除，可在 .htaccess 中添加 RewriteRule ^wp-content/plugins/mypixs/ - [F,L] 阻止对插件目录的全部访问，或将 wp-content/plugins/mypixs/ 目录重命名以禁用插件功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/94495","http://www.vapidlabs.com/advisory.php?v=154","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000012.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-1000012.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000012.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-1000012/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-1000012.py","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2015-1000012_1_3.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-1000012_1.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2015-1000012.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2015-1000012-2023-09-21-1730_2","https://github.com/foreztgump/cve_json/blob/064c5994dc5b0dca3ff5c1366813b79a53b8356d/2015/CVE-2015-1000012.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Nov/27/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/50629d052759f7d0d73f7da1b830ff6d52d10f93/nuclei-templates/2015/CVE-2015-1000012-mypixs-5413ae2a-9afa-4ff6-b241-73b446881185.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0005","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1000010","title":"WordPress simple-image-manipulator 插件远程文件下载漏洞","description":"WordPress simple-image-manipulator 插件 1.0 版本存在访问控制缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用插件中缺乏权限校验的文件下载功能，读取服务器上的任意文件（如 wp-config.php 等敏感配置文件），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 simple-image-manipulator 插件的所有版本，攻击无需用户交互，利用难度低，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1000010"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-06T14:59:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:21:16Z","remediation":"立即从 WordPress 站点删除 simple-image-manipulator 插件（该插件已于 2013 年关闭且不再维护），在 wp-content/plugins/ 目录下删除 simple-image-manipulator 文件夹。如暂时无法删除，可在 .htaccess 中添加规则阻止对 /wp-content/plugins/simple-image-manipulator/controller/download.php 的访问：`RewriteRule ^wp-content/plugins/simple-image-manipulator/ - [F,L]`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/94563","http://www.vapidlabs.com/advisory.php?v=147","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000010.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-1000010.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000010.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2015/1000xxx/CVE-2015-1000010.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2015-1000010_3.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-1000010-68af99e3772493c2869a6daa59ed7782.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-1000010.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2015-1000010.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2015-1000010-2023-09-21-1730_2","https://github.com/IDEA-Research-Group/AMADEUS/blob/ab685deeb710b4b3f39b52a7ca9bf19d9f220fe9/models.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ad32beb8a6ecc99ff5b9401392fe4eb738c13e96/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-10000xx/CVE-2015-1000010.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0004","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1000005","title":"Wordpress candidate-application-form 插件文件下载漏洞","description":"Wordpress candidate-application-form 插件 v1.0 中存在路径遍历漏洞。由于未能对用户上传的文件路径进行有效验证，攻击者可以利用不正常的目录遍历序列（如「../」）绕过安全限制，访问服务器上存储的任何敏感文件。攻击者只需发送精心构造的 HTTP 请求即可远程获取目标系统的配置文件、数据库文件、源代码及系统文件等敏感信息，严重威胁网站数据安全和系统完整性。该漏洞影响所有使用该插件的Wordpress网站，攻击无需认证即可执行，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1000005"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-10-06T14:59:05Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:21:15Z","remediation":"该插件已于 2015 年 4 月 30 日从 WordPress 官方仓库下架，不再维护更新。建议立即删除 candidate-application-form 插件，或替换为其他仍在维护的候选人申请表单插件。如暂时无法删除，可在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）层面配置规则，阻止对 `/wp-content/plugins/candidate-application-form/downloadpdffile.php` 的访问请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/97108","http://www.vapidlabs.com/advisory.php?v=142","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000005.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-1000005.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1000005.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2015/1000xxx/CVE-2015-1000005.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2015-1000005_3.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-1000005-24202c6cbbdee45d1b59d8514a7fc240.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-1000005.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2015-1000005.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2015-1000005-2023-09-21-1730_2","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2015/CVE-2015-1000005.md","https://github.com/sailuh/perceive/blob/85ca622832e25fa91d8d836b8c93a096178bb35d/Notebooks/CVE_Details/cve_details_introduction.ipynb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0061","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-8399","title":"Atlassian Confluence 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Atlassian Confluence 5.8.17 之前版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，远程认证用户可通过向 spaces/viewdefaultdecorator.action 或 admin/viewdefaultdecorator.action 的 decoratorName 参数传递包含路径遍历序列的特制请求，读取服务器上的任意配置文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者需拥有 Confluence 有效账户，利用难度较低，无需特殊权限即可实施。Atlassian 已在 5.8.17 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-8399"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-04-11T21:59:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:34:27Z","remediation":"升级至 Atlassian Confluence 5.8.17 或更高版本，该版本已修复 viewdefaultdecorator.action 的目录遍历问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制对 /spaces/viewdefaultdecorator.action 和 /admin/viewdefaultdecorator.action 路径的访问，仅允许受信 IP 或管理员网段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/537232/100/0/threaded","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39170/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39170","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8399.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-8399.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8399.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2015-8399-2619.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2015/8xxx/CVE-2015-8399.json","https://github.com/qi4L/qscan/blob/4825e3745cf34d024b1fefa986f6ba01dc34502a/core/pocScan/pocs/confluence-cve-2015-8399.yml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2015/CVE-2015-8399.py","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2015-8399-2616.yaml","https://github.com/zcyberseclab/zscan/blob/8c5a8daeed6afdf16f6945c24a51469d37a023b9/templates/coldfusion/CVE-2015-8399.yml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2015-8399-2615.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2015-8399.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0061.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0047","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-5471","title":"WordPress Swim Team插件任意文件下载漏洞","description":"WordPress Swim Team 插件 1.44.10777 版本中的 `include/user/download.php` 文件存在绝对路径遍历漏洞。由于对 `file` 参数缺乏有效的路径过滤与校验，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过传入完整绝对路径名（如 `/etc/passwd`）直接下载服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用，影响所有使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-5471"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-01-12T19:59:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:29:11Z","remediation":"立即升级 Swim Team 插件至 v1.45beta3 或更高版本（厂商已在该版本中修复了 download.php 对 file 参数未做路径过滤的问题）。该插件已从 WordPress 官方仓库下架，如无法获取更新版本，建议直接删除并停用该插件。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器层面添加访问控制规则，禁止外部直接访问 `/wp-content/plugins/wp-swimteam/include/user/download.php` 路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://michaelwalsh.org/blog/2015/07/wp-swimteam-v1-45-beta-3-now-available/","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132653/WordPress-WP-SwimTeam-1.44.10777-Arbitrary-File-Download.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/75600","http://www.vapid.dhs.org/advisory.php?v=134","https://wordpress.org/support/topic/security-vulnerability-6","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8071","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37601","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-5471.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2015/CVE-2015-5471.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f0b5f4bdc45a495b4184bd2ebc02bf95dd4ebcf7/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-5471.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-5471/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-5471.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-5471_5.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2015/CVE-2015-5471.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-5471_4.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2015-5471-2558.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/bl